 slides, and solid cubes \u2014 all arranged on a clean, grid-based surface that makes building effortless and satisfying.\n\nWhether you're creating gentle loops, experimental contraptions, elegant cascades, or massive marble factories, the game invites you to play with physics in a calm and cozy space. Every block snaps neatly into place, every color theme transforms the table into a new mood, and every marble behaves with authentic physical detail.", "summary": "On a wooden table drifting through space, build little contraptions just to see what happens. Release the marbles and enjoy the calm rhythm of their flow. A warm, curious, and delightful sandbox experience.", "themes": [{"id": 33, "name": "Sandbox"}, {"id": 34, "name": "Educational"}, {"id": 35, "name": "Kids"}, {"id": 41, "name": "4X (explore, expand, exploit, and exterminate)"}], "url": "https://www.igdb.com/games/marble-odyssey-sandbox", "videos": [{"id": 169171, "name": "Gameplay Trailer", "video_id": "LqZTyybm5Yk", "url": "https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=LqZTyybm5Yk", "title": "Marble Odyssey: Sandbox - Gameplay Trailer 1", "thumb": "https://i.ytimg.com/vi/LqZTyybm5Yk/maxresdefault.jpg"}]}